<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A macro for the roblox magic training, this macro uses various random delays in between the letters to get past the anti-macro system taht magic training has.

This uses the spell 'Crucio', but feel free to change it if you like

I recommend not changing the delays as this is as fast as I could get it without it messing up or getting detected, make sure to have a bind to disable the program incase you need to type out something if you intend to use the chat. 

Lastly, you can use the same format of my macro to write /team before the spell to ensure that no one else is able to read that you have used the spell</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 56 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyUp 56 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyDown 6 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyDown 24 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyUp 24 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyDown 6 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyDown 12 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyDown 18 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyUp 12 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyUp 18 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyDown 88 1
Delay 5 16 ms
KeyUp 88 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>